\item "block-node": \eqn{(p_1, \dots, p_Q)}, \eqn{p_q} the probability that a node of block q is
observed.
\item "block-dyad": the Q x Q matrix \eqn{(p_{ql})}, \eqn{p_{ql}} the probability that a dyad
